  "extra_data": {
    "notes": "CORRECTED WORKFLOW for 8GB VRAM:\n\n✓ Uses FP8 models: gemma_3_12B_it_fp8_e4m3fn.safetensors + ltx-2-19b-dev-fp4_projections_only.safetensors\n✓ Resolution: 512x288 (divisible by 32, safe for 8GB)\n✓ Tiled VAE: 256x256 tiles\n✓ 3 seconds at 24fps (73 frames)\n\nREQUIRED COMFYUI FLAGS:\npython main.py --listen 0.0.0.0 --port 8188 --lowvram --disable-smart-memory --reserve-vram 1.0 --preview-method none\n\nExpected VRAM usage: 6.5-7.5GB peak\n\nFor longer videos (5 sec): Increase length to 121 frames, monitor VRAM with nvidia-smi"
